        "doc": "Flag text that is trying to address the assistant.\n\nThis does not block anything and is not the defence - channel separation and\nthe pre-computed tool set are. It annotates the turn so the analyst sees\nthat the alert contained an injection attempt, which is a detection in its\nown right.",
